The Ed Bot name, logo (assets/ed-bot.png) and other branding assets are excluded
from the CC BY-SA grant for original instructions. No trademark rights or
separate permission to reuse the branding is granted by this license.

The complete CC BY-SA 4.0 legal code, rather than this scope notice, supplies
the license terms for covered material. See NOTICE.md for provenance and credits.
